        "also_known_as": [],
        "biography": "Fangs FX are renowned throughout the industry for their specialized character teeth for film, television, theatre, and multimedia promotional productions. Based in Buckinghamshire, Chris Lyons heads up a team of very talented professionals who are dedicated and reliable and offer a high quality service. Whilst very capable of working to tight deadlines they offer the creative, quality service that you would expect. This is reflected in the clientele who have come to rely on Chris and his team, from award winning personal make-up artists to special effects companies who have gone on to win BAFTA's and Oscars, Every challenge has been met with imaginative design and skill. Of prime importance are the exclusive procedures that ensure no damage to teeth or tissue is sustained by the artiste.\n\nWe offer a worldwide comprehensive mobile service which facilitates the taking of impressions and final fitting.\n\nHaving worked with many leading actors/actresses the entire team have a \"can do\" attitude when faced with challenging projects.",
